LPL Timed_Automata description

  specification description
    part Clocks of sort list[identifier]
        import identifier list[identifier]
    part States of sort list[identifier]
        import identifier list[identifier]
    part Labels of sort list[identifier]
        import identifier list[identifier]
    part Automata of sort list[Automaton]
        import Automaton[Clocks,States,Labels] list[Automaton]
  end

  query of sort pair[list[statezone],bool]
  result of sort pair[list[statezone],bool]
  import Timed_Automata[Clocks,States,Labels,Automata]
  start with (explore)query 

end